      "message": "Merge #2969 port (d3443eddc) into the straight cutoff port\n\nKeep the agie_setup split into piece.rs and cutoff.rs beside main's\ninspection.rs and publish.rs. The inspection writer takes attribute_call\nand checked from piece.rs; its output does not change. The skill row and\nthe guide put the open cutoff beside the reentrant and die text, with the\n20 mm offset row.\n\nRefs #2962\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
